        "created_at": "2025-06-12T02:50:29.271Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was able to do the bpt assignments and practice the commands in the command prompt of my windows os itself. but in the videos, they are using linux os. So is it necessary to install a linux os alongside my windos os??</p>",
